  "body_html": "<p>Elevate your bedroom with our exquisite custom photo quilt from Jeminise, where personalized comfort meets timeless style. Designed to capture your most cherished memories, this custom-made quilt is the perfect keepsake or heartfelt gift for anniversaries, birthdays, or special occasions. Crafted with care to provide lightweight warmth, it is an inviting and cozy addition to any bed, sofa, or outdoor adventure.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize every aspect of this quilt, including the background, framing color, and text saying squares. Upload your own photos and add personal text inputs to create a unique keepsake.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Comfort &amp; Warmth:</strong> Constructed with a breathable, soft outer fabric and filled with high-quality silk floss for lightweight, year-round comfort.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Perfect for indoor and outdoor settings. Use it as a bed quilt, a cozy throw blanket, a picnic mat, or bring it along for camping trips.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Durable and easy to clean, this quilt is fully machine washable and dries quickly.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> An exceptional gift idea for family members, friends, or couples. Great for Valentine's Day, Mother's Day, Father's Day, Christmas, or anniversaries.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Cotton Blend</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester &amp; Cotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Silk Floss</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Bohemian</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Custom</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Blanket Form</th>\n<td>Quilt</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Pillowcase (Optional), Quilt</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>Text and Image customization supported</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw, Twin, Full, Queen, King</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All, Spring, Winter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
